  DisplayName: Paragon Benefit (Bell)
  IconPath: icons/tools/instruments/bell-gold.webp
  Description: With your mastery of your bell, you can affect many foes with ease.
    All the condition values from @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Ring Bell]
    increase to 2 (or 3 on a critical failure). Ring Bell can trigger off the Strike
    or spell of any enemy, not just the target of your @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Exploit
    Vulnerability]; however, in that case, the condition lasts only until the start
    of your next turn.
